# Docker only

- Run tests, lint, typecheck, and service boots via Docker Compose.
- Canonical test command: `docker compose run --rm lucy-api pytest`.
- Also: `docker compose run --rm lucy-api ruff check src tests`, `ruff format --check`, `mypy src`.
- Do not treat host-venv pytest as the gate when Docker is available.
- Record exact commands and observed results; un-run commands are `BLOCKED`.
